      "id": "claim_fbfae76207804f3fa39634b29a1e7d40",
      "statement": "The asciidoctor-kroki extension (^0.18.1) is registered in antora-playbook.yml under asciidoc extensions and renders Kroki diagram blocks at build time; the playbook sets kroki-server-url to https://kroki.nmlabs.gr.",
