      "id": "claim_99d1a8a73090471fa8464ca142395039",
      "statement": "kroki-fetch-diagram: true in docs/antora.yml, combined with kroki-server-url, makes the extension fetch rendered images at build time via fetch.js save() and embed local image files in the generated HTML, so page view time does not depend on the Kroki server.",
