    {
      "id": "claim_7e85df483cdf48c5a611a1a4f07b97b2",
      "statement": "Fetching diagrams at build time creates a build-time network dependency on kroki.nmlabs.gr for new or changed diagrams; already-fetched diagrams are cached on disk (filename derived from a SHA-1 hash of the diagram URL) and reused, and if the server is unreachable the extension warns 'Skipping <type> block.' and emits the raw source in a kroki-error block instead of failing the build.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://node_modules/asciidoctor-kroki/src/asciidoctor-kroki.js#L182-L192",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7f86685be6d5075c88311da2abe182361c9d85a329ddb22d3a024f0064c57769:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://node_modules/asciidoctor-kroki/src/fetch.js#L24-L54",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:335cf817c95e045edaffe67af2ca3f956e1dec2c061e550957d8309753092b95:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ef1cf73b30cd4c37bf1205783ad20ef9",
      "statement": "The Kroki client transport is adaptive by default: short diagrams are encoded into a compressed GET URI (base64 of deflate level 9), and URIs exceeding kroki-max-uri-length (default 4000) fall back to a POST to {server}/{type}/{format}; the server URL falls back to https://kroki.io when kroki-server-url is unset.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://node_modules/asciidoctor-kroki/src/kroki-client.js#L15-L77",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f62142581697c783ca77f53dfa2c7dfb954fcb33cf160e4dd6ecb78bdefe800c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0f53509095514d6295eebf3b0423957a",
      "statement": "Diagram sources are textual and committed to version control, authored either inline in pages under docs/modules/ROOT/pages/** or as standalone .adoc fragments under specs/diagrams/; the repository ships rental_activity_diagram.adoc (rental flow activity diagram) and uml_class_diagram.adoc (domain model class diagram) as PlantUML diagrams.",
