      "id": "claim_029d6f5e548f4087bcfb81a7471f73f4",
      "statement": "The MCP ingest pipeline strips all Kroki diagram blocks as the first preprocessing step of resolveMacros, before include/xref/image normalization and rendering, because diagram source code is noise for semantic-search embeddings; this is invoked per file in mcp-server/src/index.ts before renderAdoc and chunking.",
